1d:["$","section","HOW CAN ONE WINDOW OVERSEAS EDUCATION COMPANY HELP YOU?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"HOW CAN ONE WINDOW OVERSEAS EDUCATION COMPANY HELP YOU?"}],[["$","p","If you are planning to study abroad at WSU or any other university around the world, you might need some guidance and assistance from experts who have been there and have experience.",{"children":"If you are planning to study abroad at WSU or any other university around the world, you might need some guidance and assistance from experts who have been there and have experience."}],["$","p","This is where",{"children":"This is where"}],["$","p","ONE WINDOW OVERSEAS EDUCATION",{"children":"ONE WINDOW OVERSEAS EDUCATION"}],["$","p","comes in.",{"children":"comes in."}],["$","p","One Window",{"children":"One Window"}],["$","p","is one of the leading overseas education companies in this field, we offer one-stop solutions for all your overseas education needs.",{"children":"is one of the leading overseas education companies in this field, we offer one-stop solutions for all your overseas education needs."}],["$","p","ONE WINDOW",{"children":"ONE WINDOW"}],["$","p","can help you with:",{"children":"can help you with:"}],["$","p","Best fit university",{"children":"Best fit university"}],["$","p","Scholarship assistance",{"children":"Scholarship assistance"}],["$","p","Application documentation",{"children":"Application documentation"}],["$","p","Education loan assistance",{"children":"Education loan assistance"}],["$","p","Visa interview coaching",{"children":"Visa interview coaching"}],["$","p","Conclusion:",{"children":"Conclusion:"}],["$","p","A badge program is a great way to enhance your overseas education experience and gain valuable skills that can boost your career prospects.",{"children":"A badge program is a great way to enhance your overseas education experience and gain valuable skills that can boost your career prospects."}],["$","p","WSU offers a wide range of badge programs th